## Scope

Documentation is based on repository source. Paths are repository-relative. The application source was not modified.

Key roots: `settings.gradle`, `build.gradle`, `tes-coreapi/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/coreapi/`, `tes-common/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/common/`, `tes-engine/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/engine/`, `tes-agent/src/main/java/com/onomatic/tes/agent/`.
